source('kamaishi','釜石防波堤海嘯破壞機制研究','Investigation of the Failure Mechanism of Kamaishi Breakwaters due to Tsunami','Port and Airport Research Institute','https://www.pari.go.jp/en/2012/03/20120315211424.html','二〇一二年研究摘要討論二〇一一年海嘯越流、背面負壓及模型試驗；不能只用靜水位差推算海嘯荷載。','The2012 research abstract addresses2011 tsunami overflow, rear-side negative pressure and model tests; tsunami loading cannot be reduced to still-water head difference.','Official search turn156search1 and turn156search48 give title and findings.',2012)
source('tuas','大士港第一期沉箱里程碑','Tuas Port caisson milestones','Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore','https://www.mpa.gov.sg/who-we-are/about-mpa/mpas-milestones','主管機關列二〇一六年首座沉箱與二〇二二年港口啟用；碼頭沉箱僅供構造製造比較，不當成防波堤同一受力。','Owner lists the2016 first caisson and2022 port opening; quay caissons provide a fabrication comparison, not an identical breakwater load case.','Official search turn156search2 confirms29April2016 and1September2022.',2016)
source('tuas-final','大士港第一期最後沉箱安裝','Final caisson installed for Tuas Terminal Phase1','Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore','https://www.mpa.gov.sg/media-centre/details/speech-for-ms-quah-ley-hoon-chief-executive-maritime-and-port-authority-at-tuas-terminal-phase-one-reclamation-installation-of-the-last-caisson-on-tuesday-23-april-2019','二〇一九年官方演說記錄第一期第兩百二十一座沉箱；此數字是專案紀錄，不是本課合成幾何。','Official2019 speech records the221st Phase1 caisson; this is project history, distinct from the course synthetic geometry.','Official search turn156search17 dated23April2019.',2019)
source('afsluitdijk','阿夫魯戴克海堤護面構件','Afsluitdijk concrete armour elements','Rijkswaterstaat','https://www.rijkswaterstaat.nl/en/news/archive/2025/10/second-place-2025-jan-agema-award-for-afsluitdijk-causeway-reinforcement','二〇二五年主管機關文章說明專用護面塊與粗糙空隙；不把本課合成配比當成產品規格。','The authority’s2025 article describes dedicated armour units and roughness/voids; synthetic mixtures here are not product specifications.','Official search turn156search7 confirms project-specific Levvel-bloc/XblocPlus context.',2025)
compact('b283','沿製造浮運到基床受力追蹤沉箱防波堤的狀態變化~Track caisson-breakwater state changes from fabrication and flotation to foundation loading',r'''
混凝土量與重量~Concrete volume and weight || 沉箱的外包體積、混凝土材料體積與填艙材料量是不同量，浮運和落床分析不能交換使用。重量需要逐項配平，鋼筋、臨時設備和殘留水亦會改變重心；只看外部尺寸並不能得出可靠排水量。~Envelope volume, concrete volume and ballast quantity are different quantities and cannot be exchanged between floating and seated conditions. Weight accounting also includes reinforcement, temporary equipment and retained water, all of which can shift the center of gravity despite unchanged outer dimensions. || 假設混凝土密度2400kg/m³、材料體積1000m³，質量2400000kg，重量mg=23544kN；這不是浮力所用外包體積。~Assume concrete density2400kg/m³ and material volume1000m³. Mass is2400000kg and weight23544kN; this is not the envelope volume used for buoyancy. || 依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。用吃水及已知海水密度作獨立平衡檢查，追查差異而非調整密度湊合。~Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication. Independently compare draft and water density, investigating discrepancies rather than tuning density to fit. || 將中空艙室也算成混凝土會高估重量，漏計艙水則低估吃水；兩項誤差可能偶然抵銷總重量卻留下錯誤重心，使後續浮穩判斷仍然失真。~Counting hollow cells as concrete overstates weight while omitting tank water understates draft. These errors may accidentally cancel total mass yet leave the center of gravity wrong, corrupting subsequent stability interpretation. || 沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。~Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass.
靜態吃水平衡~Static draft equilibrium || 完整密閉浮體在靜水中以排開水的重量平衡自重，矩形水線面才可用常面積直接換算吃水。艙口進水、外形變化和水面傾斜會改變條件，因此初步計算不能取代實際浮運狀態的檢查。~A sealed body at rest balances its weight with displaced water, and a constant rectangular waterplane permits direct draft conversion. Flooding, changing exterior geometry and heel alter the assumptions, so this initial calculation cannot replace verification of the actual floating condition. || 假設總質量2460000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，吃水T=m/(ρA)=6m；側高10m時靜態乾舷4m。~Assume mass2460000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². Draft T=m/(ρA)=6m; a10m side gives static freeboard4m. || 在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。另列波浪、拖航和艙口條件，避免把靜水乾舷當成任何海況的操作裕度。~Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule. Separately document waves, towing and openings rather than treating calm-water freeboard as a margin for every sea state. || 艙內漏水會使吃水增加並可能降低乾舷，僅讀取一側吃水又會漏掉傾斜。靜態平均值看似符合計算時，另一角仍可能先進水並改變整個浮力邊界。~Internal flooding increases draft and may reduce freeboard, while one-sided readings miss heel. Even a matching mean draft can conceal an exposed corner that floods first and changes the complete buoyancy boundary. || 平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。~Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant.
初穩性幾何尺度~Initial stability geometry || 小角度浮穩分析以浮心、重心和水線面慣性矩建立初穩心高度，與大角度復原力臂並不相同。水線形狀和轉動軸必須明示，不能用一個正值保證拖航中所有波浪、風力及進水情境都穩定。~Small-angle stability uses buoyancy center, gravity center and waterplane second moment to obtain metacentric height, not the full large-angle righting arm. Define the waterplane and rotation axis explicitly; a positive value cannot qualify every towing, wind, wave or flooding case. || 假設20m×20m矩形水線、吃水6m、排水V=2400m³、KB=3m、KG=7m，GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m。~Assume20m×20m waterplane,6m draft, displacement2400m³, KB=3m and KG=7m. GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m. || 在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。再檢查艙內自由液面及可能進水位置，把小角線性結果與完整浮穩需求分開。~Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers. Check internal free surfaces and flooding openings separately, distinguishing the small-angle result from complete stability requirements. || 軸向用錯會把長寬差異轉成巨大剛度誤差，重心漏算又會高估復原能力。正初穩心高度不能排除大角度失穩，也不能抵銷自由液面與波浪耦合的不利影響。~Using the wrong axis transforms length-width differences into a major stiffness error, while omitted weights overstate righting ability. Positive initial height does not exclude large-angle instability or adverse free-surface and wave coupling. || 初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。~Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.
艙內自由液面~Internal free-surface effect || 部分裝滿的艙液會隨浮體傾斜移動，等效降低初穩性；全空或全滿的情況不能套同一自由液面修正。液面慣性矩與連通範圍比液體總量更重要，因此分艙完整性是浮穩模型的一部分。~Liquid in a partially filled tank shifts with heel and reduces initial stability. Empty and pressed-full tanks do not share this correction. Surface second moment and connected extent matter more than liquid quantity alone, making compartment integrity part of the stability model. || 假設同密度艙水的自由液面10m×10m、排水2400m³，修正ΔGM=If/V=(10×10³/12)/2400=0.3472m；只適用小角近似。~Assume same-density tank water, a10m×10m free surface and2400m³ displacement. ΔGM=If/V=0.3472m under the small-angle approximation. || 逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。比較隔艙完整與連通的模型，並保存任何配置變更的浮穩再評估紀錄。~Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction. Compare isolated and connected compartments and retain the stability reassessment for every configuration change. || 隔板開孔造成原先獨立液面連通時，慣性矩可大幅增加；只看總艙水量不變會漏掉穩性下降。液位誤判為全滿也可能完全省略實際存在的自由液面。~Openings that connect previously separate tanks can greatly increase surface second moment. Unchanged total water volume conceals lost stability, and incorrectly declaring a tank full can omit an existing free surface entirely. || 艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。~An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect.
配重與吃水增量~Ballast and draft increment || 增加配重會增加排水量，但各艙位置也決定傾斜和結構內力。常水線面換算只能估平均吃水增量，不能推定所有角點同步下沉，也不能以這個靜力算式指揮實際沉放程序。~Added ballast increases displacement while its location changes heel and internal actions. A constant-waterplane conversion estimates mean draft increment only; it does not imply equal movement at every corner or authorize an actual lowering sequence from this static calculation. || 假設增重205000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m；水線面與密閉狀態保持不變。~Assume added205000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m at unchanged geometry and sealed condition. || 將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。以受核准的施工控制紀錄比較預測與量測，不用平均吃水掩蓋局部傾斜或設備故障。~Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels. Use the approved construction-control record to investigate disagreement without hiding heel or equipment faults behind mean draft. || 一側閥件或量測失效可能使平均增重正確但傾斜快速擴大，艙內自由液面也可能同時改變；若只依總重量完成指標，便會漏掉真正控制過渡狀態的介面。~A one-sided valve or measurement fault can produce the correct total added mass while heel grows. Free-surface effects may change simultaneously, so total-weight completion alone misses the interface governing the transition. || 計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。~A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence.
底面揚壓積分~Base-uplift integration || 落床沉箱底面水壓減少有效壓力接觸，分布取決於滲流、排水與波浪傳遞。兩端線性插值是一個假設，不是所有基床都會呈現的真實形狀；合力與作用點都會影響滑動和偏心。~Pressure beneath a seated caisson reduces effective contact and depends on seepage, drainage and wave transmission. Linear interpolation between edges is an assumption rather than a universal foundation pattern. Both resultant and location influence sliding and eccentric response. || 假設每米堤長、底寬20m，底壓由80線性降至20kPa，U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m；未計時變壓力。~Assume unit breakwater length,20m base width and linear pressure from80 to20kPa. U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m, excluding time variation. || 用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。將揚壓積分和接觸反力核對，另列波峰與波谷可能不同的傳壓相位。~Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity. Compare integrated uplift with contact reaction, documenting different transmission phases at wave crests and troughs rather than mixing them. || 底面中部高壓可能被端點量測漏掉，排水堵塞也會改變分布。把不同時刻的壓力峰值任意拼在一起，則可能製造不存在的合力與偏心，兩種錯誤方向都需查核。~An internal pressure high can escape edge measurements, and blocked drainage changes the distribution. Combining unrelated peak times can instead create a nonexistent force and eccentricity; both error directions require investigation. || 底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。~Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.
滑動平衡的界限~Limits of sliding equilibrium || 簡化摩擦抵抗以有效法向力為基礎，底面揚壓不能忽略。摩擦係數受材料和接觸狀態影響，動態荷載、搖擺與地基破壞則另有機制；一個比值不能涵蓋所有施工與使用狀態。~A friction estimate depends on effective normal force, including uplift reduction. Interface material and condition govern the coefficient, while dynamic loading, rocking and foundation failure involve additional mechanisms. One equilibrium ratio does not cover every construction and operational state. || 假設每米W=4000kN、U=1000kN、μ=0.6、H=1500kN，R=μ(W−U)=1800kN，R/H=1.20；非規範安全係數。~Assume per-metre W=4000kN, U=1000kN, μ=0.6 and H=1500kN. R=1800kN and R/H=1.20, not a code safety factor. || 核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。再分別列出地基、傾覆及接觸不完整的檢查，避免用一個比例替代多種失效。~Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction. Separately assess foundation behavior, overturning and incomplete contact instead of substituting one ratio for multiple mechanisms. || 揚壓上升會在外觀重量不變時降低接觸反力，底面細料流失也可能改變摩擦條件；若沿用初期乾接觸係數，計算上的餘裕會比實際系統更樂觀。~Rising uplift reduces contact while visible weight remains unchanged, and loss of fines changes the interface. Retaining an initial dry-contact coefficient can therefore overstate the margin of the actual submerged foundation system. || 沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。~A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance.
偏心與全接觸~Eccentricity and full contact || 垂直合力的偏心會改變底面壓力，矩形底面在線彈性全接觸假設下才有核心界線。邊緣計算壓力降為零表示接觸模型來到界限，超出後應改用不承拉接觸，而非讓地基承受虛構拉力。~Eccentric vertical force redistributes base pressure. The rectangular kern applies to a linear full-contact model; zero edge pressure marks its boundary. Beyond that point, use no-tension contact rather than allowing a foundation to resist fictitious tensile pressure. || 假設每米N=2000kN、M=4000kN·m、B=12m，e=M/N=2m=B/6；qmax=333.3kPa、qmin=0，為全接觸邊界。~Assume per-metre N=2000kN, M=4000kN·m and B=12m. e=2m=B/6; qmax=333.3kPa and qmin=0 at the full-contact boundary. || 明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。檢查底床平整度、接觸缺口及土體承載，不能把幾何核心條件當成完整承載驗算。~State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment. Check bedding flatness, gaps and ground resistance; the geometric kern condition is not a complete bearing-capacity assessment. || 直接接受負接觸壓力會高估有效承壓面積，局部接觸其實可能集中在狹窄邊緣；平均壓力仍小時，局部地基破壞和沉箱轉動已可能開始。~Accepting negative contact pressure overstates effective bearing area when actual contact is concentrated near an edge. Local foundation failure and caisson rotation can begin even while the computed average pressure remains modest. || 偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。~Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact.
差異沉陷與轉角~Differential settlement and rotation || 相鄰或同一沉箱兩端的差異沉陷會改變接縫、堤頂和上部設施幾何，並不等同平均下沉。小轉角可由兩點高差估算，但沉箱彎曲或局部支承變形會破壞剛體近似，需要多點資料辨識。~Differential movement changes joints, crest and upper facilities and is distinct from mean settlement. Two-point elevation difference estimates a small rigid-body rotation, but flexure or localized support deformation violates that approximation and requires additional observations to distinguish. || 假設兩端相距20m、沉陷差20mm，θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573°；只作剛體小角示意。~Assume endpoints20m apart with20mm differential settlement. θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573° is a small rigid-body illustration. || 以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。把接縫張開與基床量測相互對照，保留無法由剛體模型解釋的變形供調查。~Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals. Compare joint opening with foundation measurements and preserve deformation that the rigid-body model cannot explain for investigation. || 基準點本身移動會讓整體沉陷被抵銷，僅看兩點又可能把彎曲誤認為旋轉。若忽略局部接觸變化，後續止水損壞與上部設備偏移便難以追溯原因。~Movement of the reference hides overall settlement, while two points can confuse flexure with rotation. Ignoring local contact changes then obscures the causes of later joint leakage or misalignment in the facilities above. || 兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。~Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.
雙側水壓與越流~Two-sided pressure and overflow || 靜水壓在兩側分別積分後才可相減，單一水位差乘整面積通常會漏掉壓力分布。越流海嘯可能伴隨背面負壓和基床沖刷，已超出靜水模型；不能將正常潮位算式當成極端事件荷載。~Hydrostatic pressure is integrated separately on each side before subtraction; one head difference times the entire wall area generally misses the distribution. Tsunami overflow can include rear suction and foundation scour beyond hydrostatics, so ordinary tide calculations cannot establish extreme-event loading. || 假設同底面起算兩側靜水深8與6m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，每米淨力F=γ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN；非海嘯力。~Assume still depths8m and6m from one base and seawater γ=10.05525kN/m³. Net force per metre isγ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN, not tsunami force. || 畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。與水工試驗和事件記錄比對，明列哪些附加作用沒有包含在靜水差值中。~Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution. Compare hydraulic tests or event records and explicitly list additional actions omitted from the static pressure difference. || 越流背面吸力會在水位差相同時增加水平作用，沖刷又會削弱支承；只放大靜水力而不更新接觸與底床，可能錯過真正導致沉箱移動的組合機制。~Rear suction increases horizontal action at unchanged head difference, while scour weakens support. Multiplying static force without updating contact and bedding can miss the coupled mechanism that actually initiates caisson displacement. || 已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。~Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow.
''')
coastal_meta('b283','假設混凝土材料體積由1000增10%至1100m³、密度固定2400kg/m³，重量由23544增至25898.4kN；浮體的排水體積和重心必須另行更新，不能宣稱浮穩同步改善10%。~Increasing concrete volume from1000 to1100m³ by10% at fixed2400kg/m³ changes weight from23544 to25898.4kN. Displacement and gravity center require separate updates; stability does not automatically improve by10%.',['pwdm','kamaishi','cem','tuas','tuas-final'])
META['b283'].update(marks=['釜石灣口防波堤：越流機制比較~Kamaishi Bay breakwater: overflow mechanisms','大士港沉箱碼頭：製造浮運比較~Tuas Port caisson quay: fabrication comparison'],place=dict(name='釜石灣口公共工程背景區~Kamaishi Bay public engineering context',country='日本~Japan',lat=39.27,lng=141.89,query='Kamaishi Bay Breakwater Japan'),timeline=[('2012','港灣空港研究所發布釜石海嘯破壞機制研究~PARI publishes research on Kamaishi tsunami failure mechanisms'),('2016','新加坡主管機關記錄大士港首座沉箱安裝~Singapore authority records the first Tuas Port caisson installation'),('2019','大士港第一期最後沉箱安裝由主管機關記錄~The authority records the final Phase1 Tuas caisson installation')],codes=['香港海港工程設計手冊第四部：海堤與防波堤~Hong Kong Port Works Design Manual Part4: seawalls and breakwaters','海岸工程手冊EM1110-2-1100，分冊適用範圍內~Coastal Engineering Manual EM1110-2-1100 within its part scope'],related=['b282','b289'],history=('沉箱方法的教學重點是狀態轉換，不用單一建成年份代替全部知識歷史。日本港灣空港研究所於二〇一二年公布釜石防波堤研究，針對二〇一一年海嘯事件指出越流與背面負壓等機制。新加坡主管機關記錄二〇一六年大士港首座沉箱，以及二〇一九年第一期最後沉箱的安裝；這是碼頭建造比較，並非同一海嘯受力案例。香港及美國官方指南提供一般工程框架，仍須配合實際地盤、波況和施工階段。課程數值全為原創假設，不冒充兩地原設計圖或現場性能。','The teaching emphasis is the transition between caisson states rather than one construction year standing for the entire history. PARI published its Kamaishi investigation in2012 after the2011 tsunami, addressing overflow and rear-side pressure mechanisms. Singapore records the first Tuas caisson installation in2016 and the final Phase1 installation in2019. That quay project provides a construction comparison, not an identical tsunami load case. Hong Kong and US official guidance supply a general engineering framework requiring actual ground, waves and staging. Every numerical example is original and synthetic, not an original design drawing or measured performance from either location.'))

compact('b284','把消波構件的材料品質、形狀與安放接觸連成可追溯驗證~Connect concrete armour material quality, geometry and placed contacts through traceable verification',r'''
質量與排水體積~Mass and displaced volume || 混凝土消波構件的質量影響水下有效重量，但水工功能還取決於形狀、接觸和孔隙。從密度換算體積只是一致性檢查，不能由相同噸數推定不同專利形狀的穩定性相同，也不能取代裂縫和缺角檢查。~Concrete-unit mass influences submerged weight, while hydraulic behavior also depends on shape, contacts and voids. Density-to-volume conversion is a consistency check, not evidence that different proprietary shapes with equal tonnage have equal stability or freedom from cracking and missing corners. || 假設乾質量3000kg、材料密度2400kg/m³，實體V=M/ρ=1.25m³；海水1025kg/m³時有效重為16.86kN，非產品規格。~Assume mass3000kg and density2400kg/m³: solid V=1.25m³. In seawater1025kg/m³ effective weight is16.86kN; these are not product specifications. || 將每一代表構件的秤重、體積和含水狀態對照，查看模具尺寸及外觀紀錄是否相符。另以設計採用的形狀分類檢查接觸，避免僅用質量取代完整幾何驗證。~Compare representative unit weight, volume and moisture state with mould and visual records. Independently check contact behavior for the specified shape family rather than substituting mass measurement for complete geometric verification. || 缺角可能只減少少量質量卻破壞主要接觸臂，密度平均值因此仍合格。若只按噸數出廠，安放後互鎖下降可能直到暴風才被發現，修復亦更困難。~A missing corner may remove little mass but destroy an important contact arm while average density still passes. Mass-only release can conceal reduced interlock until a storm reveals a defect that is then harder to repair. || 任何形狀的消波塊只要質量相同就有相同水工穩定性。~Concrete armour units of any shape have identical hydraulic stability when mass matches.
有效用水與配比~Effective water accounting || 配比中的有效用水量要考慮骨材吸水與表面水，不是水表讀值單獨決定。水膠比與工作性、強度和耐久性相關，但本課示意只追蹤收支，不能由一個比值保證大型異形構件內部密實。~Effective mix water depends on aggregate absorption and surface moisture, not just the metered addition. Water-to-binder ratio relates to workability, strength and durability, but this illustration tracks accounting only; one ratio cannot guarantee consolidation inside a large complex unit. || 假設膠材340kg、加入水170kg，其中8kg被乾骨材吸收且無表面水，有效水膠比(170−8)/340=0.4765；非配方建議。~Assume binder340kg and water170kg, with8kg absorbed by dry aggregate and no surface water. Effective ratio=(170−8)/340=0.4765, not a mix recommendation. || 分別記錄骨材含水、吸水試驗和加水量，說明哪些水被計入有效水量。核對工作性與代表試體，不以現場臨時加水改善外觀而略過核准配比和追溯紀錄。~Record aggregate moisture, absorption testing and added water separately, identifying effective-water assumptions. Check workability and representative specimens without treating unrecorded field water addition as an acceptable substitute for the approved mixture. || 骨材含水變化未修正會讓相同水表數字對應不同水膠比，局部泌水或離析也可能出現。只看試體平均強度，仍可能漏掉構件細長部位的弱區。~Uncorrected aggregate moisture gives different effective ratios at identical meter readings and can produce bleeding or segregation. An acceptable average specimen strength may still conceal weak material in slender portions of the actual unit. || 每批水表加入相同水量就代表有效水膠比保持不變。~Identical metered water addition guarantees an unchanged effective water-to-binder ratio.
自由熱變形尺度~Free thermal movement scale || 大型混凝土構件的表面與內部溫度歷程不同，均勻自由伸縮只能提供基礎量級。若存在溫度梯度或模具約束，就會額外產生應力；把自由變形算式誤當成裂縫預測會遺漏養護和形狀的作用。~The surface and core of a large unit follow different temperature histories. Uniform free expansion supplies a basic scale only; gradients or mould restraint generate additional stress. Treating free movement as a crack prediction omits curing conditions and geometric effects. || 假設α=10⁻⁵/K、均勻溫差25K、長L=2m，自由變形ΔL=αΔTL=0.0005m=0.50mm；不含約束。~Assumeα=10⁻⁵/K, uniform change25K and length2m. Free movement ΔL=αΔTL=0.0005m=0.50mm, excluding restraint. || 在厚部與細臂配置相對應的溫度紀錄，區分均勻降溫與內外梯度。將實測變形和模具接觸狀態一起比較，確認採用自由膨脹假設的區段是否真的未受拘束。~Compare temperature histories in thick portions and slender arms, separating uniform cooling from gradients. Relate measured movement to mould contact and verify that portions modeled as freely expanding actually lack significant restraint. || 表面已降溫而核心仍熱時，單一平均溫度會掩蓋內外應變差；局部細臂可能先裂。即使外部總長變化很小，也不能據此排除內部自平衡熱應力。~A cooled surface with a warm core creates strain differences hidden by average temperature, potentially cracking slender arms first. Small overall length change does not exclude internal self-equilibrating thermal stress within the unit. || 整體長度變化很小就表示混凝土內部沒有熱應力。~Small overall length change proves there is no internal thermal stress.
約束冷卻與裂縫~Restrained cooling and cracking || 約束會把熱收縮轉換成拉應力，但混凝土齡期、徐變、開裂和約束鬆弛都使反應隨時間變化。完全約束線彈性式只用來比較量級，不能把固定彈性模數一路套到所有養護階段或實際裂縫寬度。~Restraint converts thermal contraction into tension, but concrete age, creep, cracking and restraint relaxation change response over time. A fully restrained elastic estimate compares scales only; fixed modulus cannot represent every curing stage or directly predict the resulting crack width. || 假設E=25GPa、α=10⁻⁵/K、完全約束冷卻25K，σ=EαΔT=6.25MPa拉應力；實際開裂與徐變需另算。~Assume E=25GPa,α=10⁻⁵/K and fully restrained cooling25K. Elastic tensionσ=EαΔT=6.25MPa; cracking and creep require separate treatment. || 記錄溫度、齡期及模具或基座約束，檢查模型採用的彈性模數與實際時間是否一致。用裂縫位置和發展時序比較可能機制，不以一個理想應力直接宣告構件可用。~Record temperature, age and mould or base restraint and match modulus to the relevant time. Compare crack locations and chronology with competing mechanisms rather than declaring a unit acceptable from one ideal elastic stress. || 以成熟混凝土模數套用早齡期可能高估或錯排應力時序，忽略徐變又改變鬆弛預測；反之僅因理論值過高而任意刪除約束，也會低估真實裂縫風險。~Using mature modulus at early age can misstate stress magnitude and timing, while omitted creep changes relaxation. Arbitrarily removing restraint merely because the theoretical stress seems high instead understates genuine cracking potential. || 完全約束彈性熱應力就是實際混凝土最後一定保留的應力。~Fully restrained elastic thermal stress is the stress the concrete must retain permanently.
試體強度與構件~Specimen strength versus unit behavior || 抗壓試體提供特定製作養護和載入條件下的材料證據，異形消波構件卻可能受彎曲、局部接觸和吊運拉力控制。試體與構件的溫度歷程、密實度和尺度不同，因此名義抗壓值不能代表全部構造能力。~Compression specimens provide evidence under specified preparation, curing and loading, while armour units can be governed by bending, local contacts and lifting tension. Their temperature histories, consolidation and size differ, so nominal compressive strength cannot describe every structural capacity of the full unit. || 假設立方試體邊長0.15m、破壞荷重900kN，f=P/A=900000/0.15²=40MPa；不是直接設計強度。~Assume a0.15m cube and failure load900kN. f=P/A=900000/0.15²=40MPa is specimen strength, not directly a design strength. || 核對試體尺寸、端面、載入方法與養護紀錄，將取樣批次連回實際構件。另檢查細臂、轉角與吊點的受力模式，避免讓抗壓試驗代替必要的材料或構造驗證。~Check specimen dimensions, ends, loading method and curing, linking each sample to its production batch. Separately review slender arms, corners and lifting points so compression testing does not replace other necessary material or structural verification. || 試體養護較好時可能高估構件內部品質，局部蜂窩又未必出現在取樣中；平均抗壓值達標仍可能伴隨吊運破裂或安放後接觸臂損傷。~Better specimen curing can overstate actual unit quality, and sampling may miss local honeycombing. A passing mean compressive strength can coexist with lifting fractures or damaged contact arms after placement at the site. || 抗壓試體合格即可證明消波構件吊點和細臂承載都合格。~Passing compression specimens also proves adequate lifting points and slender arms.
吊運力向分解~Resolving handling forces || 消波構件的吊點與重心受複雜形狀影響，索力會因夾角增加而上升。理想兩索靜力分析需同時滿足對稱與共同受力，不能取代專用吊具、動載和早齡期材料能力的核准檢查。~Complex geometry affects lifting points and gravity center, and sling force rises with inclination. An ideal two-sling static model requires symmetry and simultaneous engagement; it does not replace approved checks of lifting equipment, dynamics and early-age material capacity. || 假設質量3000kg、兩索各與垂直45°且靜態對稱，T=3000×9.81/(2cos45°)=20.81kN；未含動載或偏心。~Assume mass3000kg and two symmetric static slings45° from vertical. T=3000×9.81/(2cos45°)=20.81kN, excluding dynamics and eccentricity. || 用實際吊點與重心位置畫自由體圖，核對角度基準、各索受力及局部構件應力。保留核准吊裝方案與材料齡期紀錄，確保教學計算沒有被當作設備操作指令。~Draw the actual lifting points and gravity center, checking angle convention, sling forces and local unit stresses. Retain the approved lifting plan and material-age evidence so the teaching calculation is not used as equipment instructions. || 一索先張緊時對稱分配不成立，構件姿態轉動又會改變吊點力向；早期細臂裂縫可能在後續安放才顯現，僅查總吊重不能追出受損原因。~Symmetric sharing fails when one sling engages first, while rotation changes attachment force directions. Early cracking in slender arms may appear only after placement, and total lifted weight alone cannot explain the damage history. || 對稱吊索的理想靜力數值已包含海上起伏造成的動載。~Ideal symmetric sling forces already include dynamic loading from offshore motion.
安放密度與孔隙~Placement density and voids || 安放密度連結構件數量與覆蓋面積，但互鎖還取決於姿態、層數和接觸位置。每平方米的件數不能直接換成孔隙率，也不能只增加件數就期待水工功能改善，過密可能改變透流與局部架空。~Placement density relates unit count to area, but interlocking also depends on orientation, layers and contacts. Units per square metre cannot be directly converted into porosity, and adding more units need not improve performance because overly dense placement can alter flow and create unsupported contacts. || 假設同一層200件覆蓋1000m²，安放密度N/A=0.20件/m²；未提供體積與層厚，不能推出孔隙率。~Assume200 units cover1000m² in one layer. Placement density is0.20units/m²; without volume and thickness it does not determine porosity. || 明示面積採用水平投影或實際斜面，逐區記錄件數、姿態和接觸照片。與該構件型式核准的安放規則對照，保留局部空缺而不是用全堤平均密度掩蓋。~State whether area is horizontal projection or actual slope and record count, orientation and contacts by zone. Compare the approved rules for that unit type, preserving local gaps rather than hiding them in a whole-structure mean. || 高處多放構件可以使平均件數達標，坡腳空缺卻仍存在；架空構件在波浪下可能重新轉動。只驗收總數量，不能確認荷載和互鎖已沿斷面連續傳遞。~Extra units higher up can satisfy average count while toe gaps remain, and bridged units may rotate under waves. Total quantity alone does not establish continuous contact, load transfer or interlocking along the section. || 總安放件數達標就能證明每一個區域都有足夠互鎖。~Meeting the total unit count proves adequate interlocking in every local area.
三維位置與姿態~Three-dimensional placement geometry || 水下安放需把位置誤差與姿態誤差分開，三維坐標偏差小不代表接觸臂方向正確。測量基準、船體姿態和吊具桿臂都會影響重建位置，圖上的點位必須能追溯到構件的特定參考點。~Underwater placement separates position error from orientation error; small coordinate deviation does not establish correct contact-arm direction. Survey datum, vessel attitude and rig lever arms affect reconstruction, so each plotted position must refer to a defined point on the actual unit. || 假設參考點偏差Δx=0.10m、Δy=0.20m、Δz=0.05m，距離e=√(Δx²+Δy²+Δz²)=0.2291m；不是姿態誤差。~Assume reference-point offsets0.10m,0.20m and0.05m. Distance e=√(Δx²+Δy²+Δz²)=0.2291m does not describe orientation error. || 用獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換，將吊具參考點換算到構件指定點，另記姿態與接觸。比較安放前後的水下影像或測量資料，保留量測不確定度與盲區。~Check coordinate transformations against independent control, transfer the rig reference to the specified unit point and record orientation and contact separately. Compare underwater observations before and after placement, retaining uncertainty and blind zones. || 參考點選錯可能讓所有坐標一致偏移，姿態未記錄則無法辨識接觸臂翻轉。點位殘差小仍可能對應水工模型從未驗證過的安放方式，影響後續穩定判讀。~An incorrect reference point shifts every coordinate consistently, while missing orientation hides reversed contact arms. Small position residuals can therefore coexist with an arrangement never validated in the hydraulic model used for stability assessment. || 構件參考點位置正確就能證明其朝向與接觸也正確。~Correct reference-point coordinates prove correct orientation and contacts.
模型質量縮尺~Model mass scaling || 幾何縮尺構件的體積按長度三次方變化，相同材料密度才可直接使用相同質量比。實體試驗還需維持相對密度、表面粗糙和接觸方式，不能只做外形相似卻讓有效重量與摩擦特性失去對應。~Geometrically scaled units change volume with the cube of length, and equal material density permits the same mass ratio. Physical tests also require appropriate relative density, roughness and contacts; matching the silhouette alone does not preserve submerged weight or interface behavior. || 假設原型質量3000kg、長度比20且材料密度相同，模型質量3000/20³=0.375kg；同時需檢查水下相對密度。~Assume prototype mass3000kg, length ratio20 and equal material density. Model mass=3000/20³=0.375kg, with submerged relative density checked separately. || 同時量模型尺寸、質量及使用水體密度，檢查相對密度和有效重量是否符合試驗設計。另以安放照片比對接觸點，說明粗糙尺度不能完全相似的限制。~Measure model dimensions, mass and water density together, verifying relative density and submerged weight against the test design. Compare contact points through placement images and state limitations where surface roughness cannot be fully scaled. || 用低密度列印件卻只按長度縮小，模型可能比原型容易移動；額外加重若集中在一點又會改變重心。質量吻合仍不足以證明動態轉動完全相似。~Low-density printed units scaled only by length can move more readily than the prototype. Concentrated added weight changes gravity center, so even a matching total mass does not establish dynamically similar rotation of the unit. || 外形縮小二十倍時質量也只要縮小二十倍即可。~Scaling the shape down by twenty requires mass to decrease only twentyfold.
磨耗試驗與壽命~Abrasion testing and service life || 表面磨耗可能改變邊角和接觸粗糙度，試驗質量損失提供材料比較，卻不是直接的年損耗率。試驗介質、撞擊能量和時間與現地不同，必須把可重現的試驗排序與實際耐久機制分開。~Abrasion can alter corners and contact roughness. Test mass loss compares material response but is not a direct annual wear rate. Media, impact energy and duration differ from service, so reproducible laboratory ranking must remain separate from the mechanisms governing real durability. || 假設試樣乾質量1.000kg，指定磨耗試驗後0.950kg，損失(1−0.95)/1=5%；不能直接推成每年損失5%。~Assume dry sample1.000kg and0.950kg after a specified abrasion test. Loss is5%, which cannot be interpreted as5% annual service loss. || 核對試驗程序、含水條件與秤重時間，記錄失重之外的裂縫和缺角形態。將不同批次依同方法比較，另以現地追蹤建立環境與材料反應的關聯。~Verify test procedure, moisture condition and weighing time and record cracking or corner loss beyond mass change. Compare batches under the same method, using field follow-up separately to relate environment and material response. || 試樣表面殘水會掩蓋實際失重，破碎與均勻磨耗又可能有相同總質量差；若據此直接預測剩餘年限，會忽略局部接觸臂受損對結構功能的放大作用。~Residual water hides actual mass loss, while fragmentation and uniform wear can produce equal changes. Direct lifetime extrapolation then misses how localized damage to a contact arm disproportionately affects the function of the complete unit. || 一次磨耗試驗失重百分比就是構件每年的耗損百分比。~Mass-loss percentage in one abrasion test equals the unit's annual loss percentage.
''')
coastal_meta('b284','假設質量由3000增10%為3300kg、材料密度不變，實體體積由1.25增為1.375m³，海水中有效重量由16.86094增至18.54703kN；不是不同形狀構件可按質量互換的證明。~Increasing mass from3000 to3300kg by10% at unchanged density raises solid volume from1.25 to1.375m³ and submerged weight from16.86094 to18.54703kN. This does not justify substituting different unit shapes by mass.',['pwdm','afsluitdijk','eurotop','cem','tuas'])
